# Written and re-added by `next dev` itself, not by this tree. Ignored rather than committed so a
# dev run never leaves the tree dirty: the nightly sweep REFUSES a repo whose tree is dirty
# between its triage and its build, so a file the framework rewrites on every run would silently
# cost this product its deploy.
